2026-07-?? Version 2.1.0
------------------------

- added a web icon to the web Interface
- added 12h format for graphs as an option
- raspisump now works on Arch Linux ARM.  It is not officially supported here but is a user contribution.
All support for ARM should discuss on the Arch Linux AUR page at https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/raspi-sump



2026-06-23 Version 2.0.4
------------------------

- fixed rsumpsupport to not fail when db is unreachable
- updated menu items in Raspi-Sump Web Interface

2026-04-18 Version 2.0.3
------------------------

- Implemented security fixes as a result of code security audit
- See https://raspisumpdocs.linuxnorth.org/security  for more details.


2026-04-16 Version 2.0.2
------------------------

- fix where first alert for a mastodon user fails.
- fix double entry (0.0) into the db on invalid negative readings
- add an error log entry if invalid alert_type in raspisump.conf when heartbeat is triggered.
- add stdout error and error log entry if invalid alert_type in raspisump.conf when run alerttest

2026-03-27 Version 2.0.1
------------------------
Fixed bug where units were not changing from metric to imperial on charts and in rsumpsupport file.
Changing the unit type now takes properly on the next valid reading


2026-03-27 Version 2.0
------------------------
New release

